{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24035","headline":"哭崔常侍晦叔 · 白居易","name":"哭崔常侍晦叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顽贱一拳石，精珍百链金。\n名价既相远，交分何其深。\n中诚一以合，外物不能侵。\n逶迤二十年，与世同浮沈。\n晚有退闲约，白首归云林。\n垂老忽相失，悲哉口语心。\n春日嵩高阳，秋夜清洛阴。\n丘园共谁卜，山水共谁寻。\n风月共谁赏，诗篇共谁吟。\n花开共谁看，酒熟共谁斟。\n惠死庄杜口，锺殁师废琴。\n道理使之然，从古非独今。\n吾道自此孤，我情安可任。\n唯将病眼泪，一洒秋风襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}